| !Run for dhewm3 (Doom 3) on RISC OS
| The game data goes beside !RunImage: base (Doom 3) or demo (the free demo's demo00.pk4).
Set dhewm3$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IfThere <dhewm3$Dir>.!Sprites Then IconSprites <dhewm3$Dir>.!Sprites

| --- Runtime support ----
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error dhewm3 needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 Error dhewm3 needs ARMEABISupport 1.03 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.03 RMLoad <dhewm3$Dir>.PThrTicker
| !MesaLibs' boot runs DAClamp, which lets the heap's dynamic area grow past 128 MB
IfThere Boot:Resources.!MesaLibs Then Run Boot:Resources.!MesaLibs.!Boot
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.05 Error dhewm3 needs !RISC3D (RISC3D 0.05 or later) in !Boot.Resources

| --- Sound: SharedSoundBuffer if it's in !System, else DigitalRenderer.
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
RMEnsure DigitalRenderer 0.55 IfThere System:Modules.DRenderer Then RMLoad System:Modules.DRenderer

| Settings and saves inside the app for now
Set XDG_DATA_HOME ./home
Set XDG_CONFIG_HOME ./home

| The heap is a dynamic area, so the slot only holds the program.
WimpSlot -min 64000K -max 64000K
Dir <dhewm3$Dir>
Run <dhewm3$Dir>.!RunImage +set fs_basepath . +set r_fullscreen 0 +set r_mode -1 +set r_customWidth 800 +set r_customHeight 600 %*0 >/<dhewm3$Dir>/stdout 2>/<dhewm3$Dir>/stderr
